      "sourceUrl": "https://www.aquariumglaser.de/en/25-perchlike-fishes/25g-perchlike-fishes-7-remaining-groups/toxotes_blythii_en/",
      "html": "<p>The animals of the current importation have a very uniform pattern; this is quite different to the specimens observed in former importations. Possibly the fish in the current import represent even a species new to science, for there are a lot of hints that the real diversity and species-richness in archerfish is not understood yet. Currently only 7 species are recognized in the genus Toxotes.</p>"
